flowchart TB
    accTitle: Swarm: deterministic Rust engine, memory and identity
    accDescr: The deterministic Rust engine swarm-engine is Swarm’s core. A scoped native worker flow connects proposal, launch and observations. Versioned memory is a historical Go foundation; its Rust integration and public authority remain dashed.
    subgraph NATIVE["NATIVE RUST CORE"]
        PLAN["Human and supervisor<br/>Objective · proposal · criteria"]
        ENGINE["DETERMINISTIC RUST ENGINE<br/>swarm-engine · RootStore<br/>State · transitions · permissions · evidence"]
        AGENT["Worker attempt<br/>Scoped native flow"]
        FACTS["Activity · report · incident<br/>Facts and uncertainty retained"]
        PLAN -->|Proposal to check| ENGINE
        ENGINE -->|Authorized start| AGENT
        AGENT --> FACTS
        FACTS -->|Observation and recovery| ENGINE
    end
    subgraph MEMORY["GO MEMORY"]
        RETEX["Verified lessons learned<br/>Sources and conditions"]
        LESSON[("Experiences and procedures<br/>Versions and explicit selection")]
        HISTORY["History retained<br/>Withdrawal and received contexts"]
        RETEX -->|Explicit Go admission| LESSON
        LESSON --> HISTORY
    end
    subgraph IDENTITY["IDENTITY PENDING"]
        KERNEL["Internal kernel verified locally<br/>Actor · instance · plan · delegation"]
        TARGET["Protected integration pending<br/>Owner · author · usage rights"]
        KERNEL -.-> TARGET
    end
    ENGINE -.->|Rust admission and selection pending| LESSON
    LESSON -.->|Rust memory context integration pending| AGENT
    KERNEL -.->|Public authority integration pending| ENGINE
    TARGET -.->|Memory usage rights integration pending| LESSON
    classDef ordinary fill:#fffefa,stroke:#205e70,color:#062b49,stroke-width:1.6px;
    classDef engine fill:#062b49,stroke:#926300,color:#fffefa,stroke-width:3px;
    classDef memory fill:#fffefa,stroke:#926300,color:#243d4a,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef target fill:#fffefa,stroke:#926300,color:#243d4a,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4;
    class PLAN,AGENT,FACTS,RETEX,HISTORY,KERNEL ordinary;
    class ENGINE engine;
    class LESSON memory;
    class TARGET target;
    style NATIVE fill:#f5f3ec,stroke:#205e70,color:#062b49
    style MEMORY fill:#f5f3ec,stroke:#926300,color:#062b49
    style IDENTITY fill:#f5f3ec,stroke:#926300,color:#062b49,stroke-dasharray:6 4
